test "rank197: bagofwords executes generated code without validation"
  lang python
  expect VYQL-INJ-003
  code
  ```
  import io

  class StreamingCodeExecutor:
      def execute_code(self, request):
          code = request.json()["code"]
          local_namespace = {}
          with io.StringIO() as stdout_capture:
              exec(code, {}, local_namespace)
          return local_namespace
  ```

test "rank197: bagofwords validates generated code before execution"
  lang python
  reject VYQL-INJ-003
  code
  ```
  import io

  def validate_python_code(code):
      pass

  class StreamingCodeExecutor:
      def execute_code(self, request):
          code = request.json()["code"]
          validate_python_code(code)
          local_namespace = {}
          with io.StringIO() as stdout_capture:
              exec(code, {}, local_namespace)
          return local_namespace
  ```
